Status: Internal Project — Not Licensed for External Distribution

This repository ("PR HUB") is an internal tool developed for the PR &
Corporate Communications team at Stellantis Chile. It is not currently
published under an open-source license, and no license should be assumed
by default.

At present:

  - All rights to this codebase, its Knowledge Base, its Rulebook, and its
    documentation are reserved.
  - This repository is not authorized for external distribution,
    republication, or use outside of its intended internal context unless
    separately and explicitly agreed.
  - The "open-source-style" documentation and repository structure in this
    project (README, CONTRIBUTING, issue templates, etc.) reflect
    engineering practice standards adopted for internal maturity — they
    are not, by themselves, a statement that this project is or will
    become open source.

If and when a decision is made to open-source this project (in whole or in
part), this file will be replaced with an actual OSS license (e.g., MIT,
Apache 2.0, or another license chosen deliberately, with legal review as
appropriate for a corporate codebase) — a choice this document intentionally
does not make on its own.

Until that decision is made, treat this repository as:
All Rights Reserved © Stellantis Chile — PR & Corporate Communications.
